<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of French first division</p>
<p>matches on Friday:</p>
<p>Monaco 3 (Anderson 8, 63, Ikpeba 29) Le Havre 0. Halftime 2-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 5,000.</p>
<p>Strasbourg 3 (Zitelli 13, 23, Nouma 82) Nice 1 (Onorati 33).</p>
<p>2-1. 7,000.</p>
<p>Montpellier 1 (Sauzee 34) Metz 0. 1-0. 7,000.</p>
<p>Marseille 5 (Libbra 52, 53, Echouafni 57, Gravelaine 70, 85)</p>
<p>Lille 1 (Garcion 26). 0-1. 15,000.</p>
<p>Cannes 0 Lyon 1 (Casanova 39). 0-1. 4,000.</p>
<p>Nancy 1 (Bonora 64) Rennes 0. 0-0. 7,000.</p>
<p>Caen v Bastia and Guingamp v Bordeaux were postponed because</p>
<p>of flooded pitches.</p>
<p>Played on Thursday:</p>
<p>Lens 1 (Aboubacar Camara 23) Paris St Germain 2 (Patrice Loko</p>
<p>53, Rai 65). 1-0. 18,000.</p>
<p>Nantes 0 Auxerre 0. 19,000.</p>
</text>
